  "plan": "1. Create a convert.js script that:
   - Imports Three.js
   - Dynamically imports the object.js file
   - Calls createScene() to build the scene
   - Traverses the scene to collect all mesh geometries
   - Applies -90 degree X-rotation (rotation matrix) to all vertices
   - Combines all geometries into a single mesh
   - Exports to OBJ format with proper vertex and face data
2. Execute the script to generate /root/output/object.obj",
